course: dictionary
lesson: 4089
title: One word, many meanings
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Many words have more than one meaning. The word gift is one of them. To find the right meaning, read the words around it, which are its context. «Zara got a gift card for a game she does not even play.» A gift card is something given to you as a present, so here gift means a present.
explain: The same word can mean something different. Read «Her gift for music is amazing.» Here gift means a talent you are born with. The word for and the word music are the clues. Always ask: which meaning fits this sentence?
explain: Gifted is another word from gift. It means very clever or talented. Try your meaning in the sentence instead of the hard word, and check that it still makes sense.
fact: A gift is something you give to someone without asking for money, like a present.
fact: A gift can also be a special talent you are born with, like a gift for music.
fact: To gift something means to give it as a present.
fact: «Gifted» means very clever or talented.
fact: «Gift shop» and «gift card» are things you use when you buy or give presents.
exercise: «Zara got a gift card for a game she does not even play.» What is a gift here? | A special talent she was born with | *Something given to her as a present | A game she loves to play
exercise: Mia is gifted at drawing. What does gifted mean? | Very tired | Very wet | Very slow | *Very clever or talented
exercise: «Her gift for music is amazing.» Which meaning of gift is this? | *A talent you are born with | Something bought in a shop | To wrap something up
test: «Ownership is having the right to a thing; receiving a gift usually makes it yours.» What usually happens when you receive a gift? | It becomes everyone's | It gets lost | It goes back to the shop | *It becomes yours
test: What does it mean to gift something? | To lose it | To wrap it in paper | *To give it as a present | To count it
exam: «The Statue of Liberty, a gift from France, stands in New York.» In this sentence, what does gift mean? | Talent | Shop | *Present | Card
